# language: ja
# Japanese keywords with English names. Same layout as readme-user-details.sanmaime,
# so both files produce the same screens (keywords in the AST are canonical English).
画面: User Details

  要素: User Information

    条件: Viewing your own profile
    表示: Username
    かつ: Full name
    かつ: Email address

    条件: Viewing another user's profile
    表示: Username
    非表示: Full name
    かつ: Email address
